   - Joins with Post table using `join<Post, "p">` with the condition matching user_ids
   - Filters by date range using `where()` with conditions checking `created_at` is between 2025-12-01 and 2025-12-31
   - Maps the result to `ActiveUser` struct using `to<ActiveUser>`

